Subject: [PATCH] implview_plus: detailed export, interactive viewer,
 open-source cross-check

- export --detail: per-cell LUT INIT + pin map, FF/latch settings, key
  BRAM/DSP/IO/clocking properties; per-net driver/loads and routed path
- HTML viewer: module tree synced with sites, LUT equations, net search
  with routed path, clock-network layer, timing paths drawn with nets
- crosscheck: compares the export against prjxray bit2fasm of the
  bitstream (BELs, physical LUT INIT, FF/CE/SR, pips); import-nextpnr
  renders an open-flow (Yosys + nextpnr-xilinx) result
- tests for LUT-equation and route parsing; README section, NOTICE
